{
  "bodyHash": "b91c5a5354eaef74",
  "content": "<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">衝入戰場： </span>重啟</strong></h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_2881910f-6d5f-48cc-bbbb-209bbce7ec68.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">衝入戰場</span>：<span style=\"color:#fff\">重啟</span>（<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">CIB</span>：<span style=\"color:#fff\">R</span>）</strong>是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">TACZ</span>（<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Timeless and Classics</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">Zero</span>）</strong></a>的擴展包，其前身是原始的<strong>衝入戰場（CIB）</strong>擴展包！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>“CIBR v0.2 中的武士刀和警棍現已加入模組 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[TACZ] LesRaisins Tactical Equipements</span></a>。若要使用本擴展包中的近戰武器，請確保您已安裝 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">[TACZ] LesRaisins Tactical Equipements</span></a></span>。”</strong></p>\n<div><hr></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>宣傳圖片</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_a9c1886b-8788-440b-a5f6-372875b779a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"979\" height=\"413\"></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>圖片中的武器來自擴展包。（<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">M4 URGI</span>、<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Galil ACE 22</span>）</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_1e1cc7d3-2c35-4dda-a8d3-1b6bac9f18c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1050\" height=\"443\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>圖片中的武器來自擴展包。（<span style=\"color:#eccafa\">AK103 Laffey</span>、<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">DAEWOO K2</span>、<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">MK18</span>）</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_10cb607e-024b-47ef-80e6-eed863d83759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"474\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><del style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>圖片中的武器來自擴展包。（<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">LA-89</span>）</strong></del></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span>該武器已在 CIBR 版本 0.4 中被移除</span></strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_4819edbf-fa34-474a-8aab-0eb347bdb6db.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>圖片中的武器來自擴展包。（QBZ 95-1<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">、</span><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">QBZ 191</span>）</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_20c7e2ad-f75d-4562-80ad-7ec0fd2ab667.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"473\"></strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>圖片中的武器來自擴展包。（<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">9A91</span>、<span style=\"color:#34495e\">Type20</span>、AK103、<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">SCORPION EVO 3</span></span>）</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">圖片中的所有渲染圖均由 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Mineimator</span> 製作。</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>介紹</strong></span></h1>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB:R</strong></span> 是 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB</strong></span> 的重製版本，原作者 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>LESHUAN_20</strong> </span>已對之前的 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB</strong> </span>擴展包進行了全面的優化與升級。</span></div>\n<div><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB:R</strong></span> 致力於為玩家提供更豐富的獨特武器選擇。它為 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>TACZ</strong></span> 添加了新的槍械模型、動畫和音效，進一步豐富了遊戲的軍火庫。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>主要特點：</strong></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>新武器</strong></span>：<br><strong>CIB:R</strong> 擴展包引入了多種新武器，包括現實中的經典槍械、虛構作品中的獨特武器以及武器皮膚！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_9c7a063b-e2ff-4c79-b469-1745a87f1f97.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"663\" height=\"387\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_2d9f9425-2eaf-4be2-b8d7-a324f4c66812.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"414\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>武器工作台</strong></span>：<br>玩家可以通過擴展包內置的獨立武器工作台來製作和升級武器，並新增了武器改裝模板。<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_b6625340-88cd-41be-a204-e81cffb8e05b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"668\" height=\"380\"></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>體驗優化</strong></span>：<br>與之前的 <strong>CIB</strong> 不同，<strong>CIB:R</strong> 對許多舊版 <strong>CIB</strong> 武器進行了重新設計，部分武器的模型、紋理和動畫得到了徹底重做。<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_e2007331-0855-4be0-be2d-7b5c012dc840.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"404\"><strong>CIB:R</strong> 還優化了舊 <strong>CIB</strong> 模型的多邊形數量，並為第三人稱視角下的每把武器添加了<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">低多邊形渲染</span></strong>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_f12c00e0-80f5-4c3e-a510-f9ff8a05fab6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"382\" height=\"148\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_35a2ac75-6478-4434-a257-7d3754e0646c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"157\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h5><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">1. 支持版本：</span></span></strong></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>CIB:R</strong></span> 擴展包支持 TACZ 的以下 Minecraft 版本</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">1.18.2、1.19.2、1.20.1。</span></h5>\n<div>\n<h5><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">2.</span> 支持語言</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">：</span></strong></h5>\n</div>\n<div><code><strong>zh_CN </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[簡體中文]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>zh_TW </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[繁體中文]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>zh_HK </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[繁體中文]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>en_US </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[美式英語]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>ja_JP </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[日語]</span></strong></div>\n<div><code><strong>ko_KR </strong></code><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">[韓語]</span></strong></div>\n<h5>（部分翻譯可能不夠準確。）</h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\">未來計劃添加更多語言。</span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>3. 安裝方法：</strong></span></h5>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">注意：這不是一個模組。請勿將其放入遊戲的 \"mods\" 資料夾中，否則將無法正常工作。</span></h5>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">您還需要安裝</span><strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ</a></span> </strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">模組以確保此擴展包能正常運行。</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">將擴展包的 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>.zip</strong></span> 文件放入</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">資料夾中。</span><code><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>.minecraft/tacz</strong></span></code></h5>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">結語</span></strong></h1>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">隨著版本的更新，我們為玩家帶來了全新的武器與裝備體驗。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">感謝您體驗 <strong>衝入戰場：重啟 (CIB:R)</strong>。希望您喜歡這些新武器和戰術玩法。您的支持是我們不斷改進的動力，期待您的反饋與建議！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#fff;float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_071c1608-7f67-487f-b88c-744bce5a9935.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"357\" height=\"113\">&nbsp;<img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_b273fbdf-141c-45a2-acaf-b729550899a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>以下是舊版文檔。</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075478/description_49eff4f1-94cd-4144-9fd1-398c128c3310.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"134\"></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>CIB 時期舊版廢棄文檔</strong></h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><em>此文檔適用於 CIB 與 TACZ 1.0.3 以下版本的兼容性。</em></div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b05b1ecc-b73a-4215-abba-965822a515e0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"358\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Timeless and Classics</span> </strong><strong style=\"color:#58b6f4\">Zero </strong><span style=\"color:#89261d\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">X</span> </span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">CHARGE</span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">IN<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">TO BATTLE <span style=\"color:#fff\">PACK</span></span></span></strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">這是社區的武器擴展包，您需要安裝其模組依賴項 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Guns:Zero</a></span></span></strong></h2>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必須安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\">Timeless and Classics Guns: Zero</span></a> 模組並將其放置在遊戲目錄的 mods 資料夾中，否則槍械擴展包將無效</span></strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">這不是模組。不要把它放在 mods 資料夾中！！！！！！</span></strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>擴展概述：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>這是 TACZ 的擴展包<br>名為衝入戰場，簡稱 CIB</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>截圖</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><strong style=\"color:#7e8c8d;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_780e7a56-3b05-4fcf-9a4e-c0a10935944a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>IMI GALIL ACE 22</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5fed4d26-8e45-4758-bae2-a925577e6472.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>CALL OF DUTY 19 MWII&nbsp; &nbsp;M4 URGI</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4913b06d-8860-4305-bf19-2c67b09dc587.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>QBZ 95-1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_35637525-c087-4e80-a7cd-dd634d574197.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>Origin12 (改裝)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e675898f-0736-42a5-812e-9db6fc4e0ff3.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#58b6f4\"><strong>HK-USP (改裝)</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>下載 ZIP 檔案後找到您的 Minecraft 遊戲目錄，解壓並將內容導入至以下路徑：</strong></span></p><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><code><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">{config<strong>/</strong>tacz<strong>/</strong>custom}</span></code></span><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>這是文件路徑</strong></span><code><span style=\"color:#3598db\"> </span>&nbsp;</code></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">再次強調，這不是模組，而是擴展包。您需要安裝依賴模組才能正常運行，並將其正確導入槍支包路徑中，否則擴展包將無法運行</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>注意事項：</strong></span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>嚴禁未經授權修改和重新分發本擴展包。</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>此版本為正式版，但仍存在許多問題</strong></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>開發進度說明：</strong></span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">目前武器套件中包含十種武器。在確認槍支包測試版正確無誤之前，我們不會考慮添加新武器</span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>我們非常感謝用戶的反饋，這有助於我們不斷提高質量。</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>當前問題</strong><strong>：</strong></span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>內格夫步槍的動畫尚未重置，彈鏈功能存在錯誤</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>部分武器動畫和模型可能不夠完整</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>結語：</strong></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>希望您喜歡我們的武器包<br>如果有任何問題，歡迎反饋，我們將根據您的反饋進行調整或更新<br></strong></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
